    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1  Indicator 7</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: 1. Rural infrastructure is improved 
Indicator: - 20 associations for road O&amp;M are formed. 
Progress/Status: 22 road maintenance committees have been formed with 20% women membership. 
